# json tool

The front end over mm.json: --check validates files and names the first fault
by file, line, and column; --indent and --compact write a file back in the
writer's two layouts; --scan prints the scanner's tokens. It does nothing the
module does not already do. The target lock is inherited from tools/mm.mdy.
